### Lấy danh sách posts cho một event (public)
GET http://localhost:8000/posts?eventId=some-event-id&page=1&limit=10

### Lấy post theo ID (public)
GET http://localhost:8000/posts/some-post-id

### Tạo post mới (authenticated)
POST http://localhost:8000/posts/event/some-event-id
Authorization: Bearer your-jwt-token-here
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "Đây là nội dung bài post",
  "images": ["https://example.com/image1.jpg"],
  "videos": ["https://example.com/video1.mp4"]
}

### Cập nhật post (authenticated)
PUT http://localhost:8000/posts/some-post-id
Authorization: Bearer your-jwt-token-here
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "Nội dung đã cập nhật"
}

### Xóa post (authenticated)
DELETE http://localhost:8000/posts/some-post-id
Authorization: Bearer your-jwt-token-here

### Thích/Bỏ thích post (authenticated)
POST http://localhost:8000/posts/some-post-id/like
Authorization: Bearer your-jwt-token-here

### Thêm comment vào post (authenticated)
POST http://localhost:8000/posts/some-post-id/comments
Authorization: Bearer your-jwt-token-here
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "Đây là comment"
}

### Lấy comments của post (public)
GET http://localhost:8000/posts/some-post-id/comments?page=1&limit=20

### Cập nhật comment (authenticated)
PUT http://localhost:8000/posts/some-post-id/comments/some-comment-id
Authorization: Bearer your-jwt-token-here
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "Comment đã cập nhật"
}

### Xóa comment (authenticated)
DELETE http://localhost:8000/posts/some-post-id/comments/some-comment-id
Authorization: Bearer your-jwt-token-here

### Ghim post (admin/event_manager)
POST http://localhost:8000/posts/some-post-id/pin
Authorization: Bearer your-admin-jwt-token-here

### Bỏ ghim post (admin/event_manager)
POST http://localhost:8000/posts/some-post-id/unpin
Authorization: Bearer your-admin-jwt-token-here